# Tadabbur Quran

A full-stack Quran reflection app with a search-first, Arabic-oriented experience.

## Important legal note

This project does not include the full text of Tafsir al-Shaarawi without explicit rights permissions. Instead, the app is designed to:
- search the Quran text
- link to approved source material
- allow a safe tafsir metadata layer
- keep rights-sensitive text behind a clear licensing workflow

## Features
- Quran chapter and verse search
- Arabic text display
- translation support ready for import
- MongoDB-backed data model
- tafsir source registry

## Run locally

### 1) Install dependencies

```bash
cd backend && npm install
cd ../web && npm install
```

### 2) Start MongoDB

```bash
docker-compose up -d mongo
```

### 3) Download Quran data

```bash
cd backend
cp ../.env.example ../.env
npm run fetch:quran
npm run import:quran
```

### 4) Start services

```bash
# API
cd backend
npm run dev

# Frontend
cd web
npm run dev
```

Then open:
- http://localhost:3000
- http://localhost:5000/api/health

## Notes on Tafsir sources

If you want to add a tafsir source like Al-Shaarawi, do not upload the full copyrighted text without written authorization. Use:
- official website URLs
- metadata only
- excerpt/summary workflows
- license verification before publishing

## Repo purpose

This repository is a starter project and MVP to build a full Quran reflection platform.
